  "scope": "Paper02 Unit 003 only: restore the five-column continuation schema, its terminal upper row, two verified rosette attachment marks, and explicit lower source-note association while preserving Ukrainian prose and the localized note byte for byte.",
  "summary": "The Ukrainian Paper02 schema now carries the complete ED0014/printed-source geometry rather than the inherited four-column truncation. Both source rosettes are restored from the adjudicated authority asset; no Ukrainian wording, formula variable, citation, label, or cross-reference was changed.",
  "human_companion": {
